# Code style and comments

## Comments

- Default: **no comments**.
- Comment only for wire contracts, auth/booking gates, invariants, or non-obvious side effects.
- No narrating code, commented-out dead code, or kit/site/brand references.
- Short JSDoc on exports only when the name is not enough.

## Code

- Thin `page.tsx` — logic in `lib/` or `components/booking|marketing`.
- One primary export per feature file; helpers stay private in-file.
- Import order: external → `@/` → relative; use `import type` for types.
- `"use client"` only when required.
- One booking state model; do not re-declare journey fields in every step.
- Fail at boundaries (env, quote, pay); do not swallow errors.
- Prettier + ESLint; no dual or legacy paths in this greenfield app.
